{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はNHK「ごごナマ」出演しました〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2017/06/19/8286537/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1時間トーク\nその後歌唱披露\n生放送でこんなボリューミーなのは初めてで\nとてもありがたく楽しかったです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2017/06/19/8286537/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クミさんの話はどれも面白く深く\n聞き入ってしまう...\nまたぜひお聞きしたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2017/06/19/8286537/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌唱披露は\n「プリュメ街〜心は愛に溢れて」\n凛子さんと大希さんと共に3重唱"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてクミさん駒田さんの\n「結婚式」\nでした☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"緊張も楽しめるようになってきた最近です。\nとはいえ生歌生放送はやはり震えそうになる...\n慣れないだろうけど慣れるように\n頑張りたいなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにトークで言ってた\n朝モリモリ食べる件"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日の朝ごはんはこちら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2017/06/19/8286537/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気合い入れて食べ過ぎてちょっと苦しかった〜笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近頃、乃木坂についての話題がブログで少ない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いでよっ 真夏！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2017/06/19/8286537/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2017/06/19/8286537/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばぁ〜い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}